<title>HONG KONG: Oriental Press year net jumps 731 pct.</title>
<headline>Oriental Press year net jumps 731 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   14.36    vs 1.73</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    10.0     vs 2.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    208.61   vs 25.08</p>
<p>    Turnover		     1,611.17 vs 1,378.01</p>
<p>    Company name		 Oriental Press Group Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  August 8-15</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   August 25</p>
<p>NOTE - Oriental Press Group is a publisher.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 13 H.K. cents (including interim dividend of three cents) vs five cents</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
